# Folder Structure

## Main Tree

```
src/
├── app/                    # Global setup (providers, router, guards)
├── features/               # Feature-based modules (auth, professionals, etc.)
├── components/             # Reusable UI (shadcn, layout)
├── services/               # API client, external services
├── shared/                 # Types, enums, DTOs, constants
└── lib/                    # Utilities (cn, helpers)
```

## Where Does My File Go?

| File Type | Location | Example |
|-----------|----------|---------|
| Page/View | `features/[feature]/pages/` | `features/auth/pages/LoginPage.tsx` |
| Feature hook | `features/[feature]/hooks.ts` | `features/professionals/hooks.ts` |
| Feature API | `features/[feature]/api.ts` | `features/appointments/api.ts` |
| Feature component | `features/[feature]/components/` | `features/availability/components/TimeSlot.tsx` |
| Generic UI component | `components/ui/` | `components/ui/button.tsx` |
| Layout component | `components/layout/` | `components/layout/Navbar.tsx` |
| Global provider | `app/providers/` | `app/providers/auth.provider.tsx` |
| Guard | `app/guards/` | `app/guards/auth.guard.tsx` |
| Type/DTO | `shared/dtos/` | `shared/dtos/user.dto.ts` |
| Enum | `shared/enums/` | `shared/enums/roles.enum.ts` |
| Constant | `shared/constants/` | `shared/constants/api.constants.ts` |
| Utility | `lib/` | `lib/utils.ts` |

## Main Features

```
features/
├── auth/              # Login, registration, authentication
├── professionals/     # Listing, profile, professional search
├── availability/      # Available schedule management
└── appointments/      # Appointment booking and management
```

## Naming Rules

- **Pages**: `PascalCase` with `Page` suffix → `LoginPage.tsx`
- **Components**: `PascalCase` → `TimeSlot.tsx`
- **Hooks**: `camelCase` with `use` prefix → `useAuth.ts`
- **Utils/Services**: `kebab-case` → `api-client.ts`
